### Test adding an account with valid data
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/editAccountController/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "testUser",
  "password": "testPassword",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}


### Test adding an account with missing userName (should fail validation)
POST http://localhost:8080/editAccountController/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "",
  "password": "testPassword",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### Test adding an account with missing password (should fail validation)
POST http://localhost:8080/editAccountController/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "testUser",
  "password": "",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### Test adding an account without email (should succeed as email is not required)
POST http://localhost:8080/editAccountController/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "testUser",
  "password": "testPassword"
}